Package: georefGN
Type: Package
Title: Georeferencing Herbarium and GBIF Occurrences with GeoNames and Collector Itineraries
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("[À COMPLÉTER]", "[À COMPLÉTER]", email = "a.completer@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Assigns coordinates to occurrence records (e.g. GBIF herbarium
    specimens) that only have a textual locality description. Records are
    first matched to georeferenced records of the same collector at the same
    GeoNames place within a short time window; undated specimens can be dated
    from their collection number. Remaining records are georeferenced from the
    place names found in their locality text, using the GeoNames gazetteer and
    its alternate names, with homonym resolution and distance-direction offsets
    ("10 km N of Man"). Original coordinates are checked for latitude/longitude
    swaps and sign errors. The package also provides a repeated-masking
    validation and a comparison of IUCN criterion B metrics computed with
    'ConR' before and after georeferencing.
